{"adoption_status":"unknown","artifact_refs":[],"attrs":{},"entry_id":"d35318cfd895aa147a6afe6de6967c9c","epistemic_status":"asserted","evidence_ids":["17533ccc9978aa867e603add4931d2ec","7db186ecf793532893a8ca43b33cc93d"],"kind":"conclusion","observed_at_seq":77,"producer":"deterministic-prototype-v0.1","record_id":"d35318cfd895aa147a6afe6de6967c9c","revision":1,"run_id":"openhands-DeepSeek__DeepSeek-V3.2-compile-compcert-94fdfa2e","source_step_ids":[77],"text":"Successfully built CompCert C verified compiler version 3.13.1 from source for x86_64-linux. The compiler is now available at `/tmp/CompCert/ccomp` (a symlink to `/tmp/CompCert/bin/ccomp`). \n\nSteps completed:\n1. Created directory `/tmp/CompCert` and downloaded CompCert 3.13.1 source\n2. Installed build dependencies: OCaml, Coq 8.18, Menhir, and libmenhir-ocaml-dev\n3. Configured for x86_64-linux target with prefix `/tmp/CompCert`, using `-ignore-coq-version` flag due to Coq 8.18 being newer than supported\n4. Patched `flocq/Calc/Bracket.v` to use `Z_div_mod_eq_full` instead of `Z_div_mod_eq` for compatibility with Coq 8.18\n5. Built the compiler (`make ccomp`) successfully\n6. Built runtime library (`make runtime`)\n7. Installed to `/tmp/CompCert` directory (`make install`)\n8. Created symlink `/tmp/CompCert/ccomp` for direct invocation\n\nThe compiler is fully functional and can compile C programs as verified by a test compilation."}
